## 🚀 About Me

I'm a **Senior DevSecOps / Platform Engineer** with hands-on ownership of production cloud infrastructure, Kubernetes platforms, security operations, and automation.

My work spans:

- ☸️ Kubernetes Platform Engineering
- 🔒 DevSecOps & Cloud Security
- 🚀 CI/CD & Infrastructure Automation
- 📈 Observability & SRE
- 🤖 AI Infrastructure & Self-hosted LLMs
